+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Alexander Sack <asac@pantacor.com>
+Date: Sat, 17 Jan 2026 13:20:28 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] Add lxc.rootfs.bdev_type config key
+
+Expose rootfs.__bdev_type via the config API so external consumers
+can read the block device type separately from rootfs.path.
+
+This is needed because setting lxc.rootfs.path strips the bdev_type
+prefix, but Pantavisor needs to read it back for overlay configuration.
